        Servicios (Cerebro)<br><span style="font-size: 8pt; font-weight: normal;">(Service / Lógica de Negocio)</span>
      </div>
    </td>
    <td align="center" style="width: 6%; font-size: 20pt; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: bold;">&rarr;</td>
    <td align="center" style="width: 22%;">
      <div style="background-color: #60a5fa; color: white; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Segoe UI'; font-size: 11pt; box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);">
